    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take Stock!</strong> puts you into a wacky world as a stock trader, working to become the best there is! Heavily inspired by <i>Market Crashers</i> and <i>Bankruptcy</i>, you need to use all the information on your trusty newspaper to make informed decisions to make the most money!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A relaxing... </strong>- Slower-paced gameplay with ample time to react and an auto buy and sell bot for a specified stock, perfect for multi-tasking!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>...yet strategic gameplay loop! </strong>- Use your daily newspaper to make informed decisions and make a large profit!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monochromatic art style! </strong>- Most game graphics use a similar palette, which you can change to any color you'd like!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take Stock!</strong> puts you into a wacky world as a stock trader, working to become the best there is! Heavily inspired by <i>Market Crashers</i> and <i>Bankruptcy</i>, you need to use all the information on your trusty newspaper to make informed decisions to make the most money!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A relaxing... </strong>- Slower-paced gameplay with ample time to react and an auto buy and sell bot for a specified stock, perfect for multi-tasking!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>...yet strategic gameplay loop! </strong>- Use your daily newspaper to make informed decisions and make a large profit!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monochromatic art style! </strong>- Most game graphics use a similar palette, which you can change to any color you'd like!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Take Stock! is the ultimate wacky stock trading simulation strategy game! You take your time getting information about stocks in order to make the most profit buying and selling shares. Featuring a colorful monochromatic art style!",
